      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046544">AVX512VL</para>
      <para unique="1046545">AVX512_VBMI) OR AVX10.1<anchor id="+760195"/></para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1046547">Permute bytes in ymm3/m256 using byte indexes in ymm2 and store the result in ymm1 using writemask k1.</para>
      </td>
